{
  "format": 1,
  "orientation": "landscape",
  "name": "The Filling Station Gardendale: menu board, 55\" landscape (DP-13 T2 sample)",
  "notes": "A sample for The Filling Station Pizza Café & Bar (Gardendale), for Scot's pitch to the owner: their own menu, prices, hours, logo, colours and photos (thefillingstationgardendale.com, November 2026), in the WayTuGo Samples account only, never shown to another prospect. Built like the Hwy 31 template (template-italian-55.json). Upload the pictures first (layouts/the-filling-station-pictures.md), paste this on the Design tab and Check, Make lists from this layout, Preview and Publish. Today's specials follows their week: weekday lunch 11–3 (dine-in), happy hour Mon–Fri 3–6, a dinner special Monday to Thursday from 5, live music Fri–Sun 6–9, karaoke Sunday 9–11, gameday nachos at the weekend, and their 24 taps late on Fridays and Saturdays.",
